{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 5703, "capacity": 13, "raw_hex": "73655f65765f3230332e736e64", "baseline_text": "se_ev_203.snd", "kind": "ascr", "source": "se_ev_203.snd", "pointer_offset": 5348, "unit": "dialogue:a30b08840bac69af", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 5717, "capacity": 17, "raw_hex": "65763032303033534b616d30302e6d626f", "baseline_text": "ev02003SKam00.mbo", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ev02003SKam00.mbo", "pointer_offset": 5352, "unit": "dialogue:c9e910628179bb9a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 5735, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f2cef1adf7d12f2ff15af256f0f1fac0f2e4f0c7f557f35df0cef0b8f0cf81442f2ffaccf184f1f7f0ccf0f0f0ef81608144", "baseline_text": "후우…//어떻게든 쓰러뜨렸습니다．//꽤 고전했네요～．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ふぅ……//なんとか倒しました。//けっこうてこずりましたね～。", "pointer_offset": 5356, "unit": "dialogue:82c8b200bac77845", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 5796, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0b1f148f0bcf167f957f0d8f27ef0f12f2ff1fcf144f0a4f0a4f8f4f287f2e9f184f7d12f2ff271f8f9f250f1cef0b2f1488144", "baseline_text": "하나야시키는 그렇게//망가지지도 않았고…//모두 덕분이야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "花やしきもそんなに//壊れてへんし……//みんなのおかげや。", "pointer_offset": 5360, "unit": "dialogue:941000c012c10444", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 5853, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0cff1a7f0b2f1488143f0b3f0b481442f2ff293f147f951f3e3f0f32f2ff8cff2c8f960f184f1d9f0fa8144", "baseline_text": "다행이야，홍란．//부서진 곳은//다 함께 고치자．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よかったね、紅蘭。//こわれたところは、//みんなでなおそうね。", "pointer_offset": 5364, "unit": "dialogue:249458e3f1bae960", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 5914, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "657630323030336b62326f6730312e6d626f", "baseline_text": "ev02003kb2og01.mbo", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ev02003kb2og01.mbo", "pointer_offset": 5368, "unit": "dialogue:d11824df0b84468b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 5933, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f25c8143f25cf14881ac2f2ff17bf9d3f2d9f14ff144f7d18148", "baseline_text": "뭐，뭐야〓//금빛 증기가…？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "な、なに〓//金色の蒸気が……？", "pointer_offset": 5372, "unit": "dialogue:b8021ddd67bd2859", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 5964, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f15af256f8f1f9fbf1c8f14881482f2ff1adf8aef177f16bf0f42f2ff2adf1e2f0a5f957f28af144f7d18148", "baseline_text": "어떻게 된 거야？//우리 광무도//폭주하는 건가…？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "どうしたって言うんだ？//ボクたちの光武も、//暴走するのか……？", "pointer_offset": 5376, "unit": "dialogue:1b1c7ae77b28b48d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6027, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f15af256f8f1f9fbf1c8f148f7d181482f2ff271f0f9f8e1f369f36df8b2f0dff0a3f944f243f95af154f15a8144", "baseline_text": "어떻게 된 거야…？//모두의 영력이 제로가 되어 있어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "どういうことや……？//みんなの霊力がゼロになっとる。", "pointer_offset": 5380, "unit": "dialogue:c9330ddc58a6b605", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0029", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6080, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa62f1ccf8b2f154f8c8f8aef1b5f15a81442f2ff1adf8aef369f36df0b22f2ff0dff0a3f944f243f0cff0b8f7d1", "baseline_text": "이런 일이 있을 리 없어．//우리 영력이//제로가 되다니…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "こんなことあるはずない。//ウチらの霊力が//ゼロになるなんて……", "pointer_offset": 5384, "unit": "dialogue:7ebb4090c88e8439", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0030", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 7025, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0d88143f0d8fa6ff0aef14481ac2f2ff1cefaaaf2e4f0c7f557f35df8c8f296f18d81b8", "baseline_text": "그，그럴 리가〓//분명 쓰러뜨렸을 텐데∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そ、そんな〓//倒したはずなのに！", "pointer_offset": 5388, "unit": "dialogue:c44c33e5040386de", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0031", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6176, "capacity": 15, "raw_hex": "657630323030336d7230302e676f32", "baseline_text": "ev02003mr00.go2", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ev02003mr00.go2", "pointer_offset": 5392, "unit": "dialogue:ad2208632d8669e3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0032", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6192, "capacity": 15, "raw_hex": "657630323030336d7230302e677274", "baseline_text": "ev02003mr00.grt", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ev02003mr00.grt", "pointer_offset": 5396, "unit": "dialogue:9bfee4877369dccd", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0033", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6208, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f3d3f0e481b82f2ff177f16bf944f25ef374f0b2f8a4f287f0af81b82f2ff15af3b0f14bf148f7d1", "baseline_text": "젠장∈//광무가 움직이지 않아∈//어떡해야…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "くそっ！//光武が動かない∈//どうすれば……", "pointer_offset": 5400, "unit": "dialogue:fa2388a8609aebfc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0034", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 7062, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f27a81b82f2ff273f274f0a2f367f0b8f26181b8", "baseline_text": "대장님∈//괜찮으십니까∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長∈//大丈夫ですか！", "pointer_offset": 5404, "unit": "dialogue:994bf650674e9979", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0035", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6274, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0adf0aef0aff7d1f250f1cef8b9f199f2e9f15a81442f2ff184f0adf1c98144", "baseline_text": "마리아…덕분에 살았어．//고마워．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "マリア……助かったよ、//ありがとう。", "pointer_offset": 5408, "unit": "dialogue:6b19643390d1bb02", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0036", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6311, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "fb89f0d8f14381482f2ff1f7fad6f140f8b9f4e0f0a5f8b8f947f154f0cff0b881432f2ff25af195f8a4f287f0f08144", "baseline_text": "왜 그래？//전투 중에 멍하니 서 있다니，//너답지 않네．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "どうしたんだよ？//戦闘中に棒立ちなんて、//らしくねぇな。", "pointer_offset": 5412, "unit": "dialogue:3883b7ef49628dbf", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0037", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6368, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b8f0eff7d1f1def0faf94ff177f16bf1442f2ff25ef374f0b2f8a4f287f0aff147f7d1", "baseline_text": "아니요…갑자기 광무가//움직이지 않아서…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いえ……急に光武が//動かなくなってしまって……", "pointer_offset": 5416, "unit": "dialogue:aba41f93abfe59f4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0038", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6415, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f0a6f0a7f8a8f247f0a8f1c781432f2ff4d6f984f154f1f3f955f28a2f2ff0aff0b8f0b9f0ef8148", "baseline_text": "사쿠라 씨라면，//졸고 있었던 건//아니에요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "さくらさんのことですから、//居眠りをしていたのでは//ありませんこと？", "pointer_offset": 5420, "unit": "dialogue:d98d2bd80e66d53b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0039", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6484, "capacity": 78, "raw_hex": "f7d1f2d9f14ff14ff17cf8b2f0edf0ebf8c8f3c0f779f15a81442f2ff14ef17bf9d4fab8f35ef1f3f2b8f0a8f1c7f7d1f1adf0ae2f2ff177f16bf8f4f2adf1e2f0ccf0c8f0a4f8f4f3a7f0a88144", "baseline_text": "…증기기관이 작동을 멈췄어．//조금만 더 늦었더라면…우리//광무도 폭주했을지도 몰라．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……蒸気機関が作動停止した。//あと少し遅ければ……ボクたちの//光武も暴走したかもしれない。", "pointer_offset": 5424, "unit": "dialogue:3e92a11859d049d0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0040", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6575, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "8169f177f16bf944f25ef374f0b2f8a4f287f0cff0b8f7d12f2ff0e2faa4f15af256f8f1f9fbf1c8f0a48148816a", "baseline_text": "（광무가 움직이지 않다니…//대체 어떻게 된 거지？）", "kind": "ascr", "source": "（光武が動かなくなるなんて……//　どういうことなんだ？）", "pointer_offset": 5428, "unit": "dialogue:a9c45e8135495bb5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0041", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6632, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f1ccf965f0dff162f25ff0e4f0a2f8a3f0d0f0aff144f0fa81442f2ff0b2fa48f1ccf0f3f7d12f2ff19cf944f14ef0a6f94bf1bcf0f18144", "baseline_text": "일단 제국극장으로 돌아가자．//이번 일은…//내가 조사해 둘게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いったん、帝劇に戻ろう。//今回のことは……//俺が調査しておく。", "pointer_offset": 5432, "unit": "dialogue:322efd966cb8cb53", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0042", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6695, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f154f276f0af8143f15af1b2f98cf0b2f148f14ff1572f2ff0dff34df0f9f184f7d12f2ff2b6f0dff8b1f0a5f955f1c88143f0a5f0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "있잖아，어려운 이야기는//제쳐두고…//언제나 하던 거，하자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ねぇねぇ、むずかしいことは//おいといて……//いつものやつ、やろうよ！", "pointer_offset": 5436, "unit": "dialogue:26113b1c191ef328", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0043", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6764, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a5f0a5f7d1f15afaa8f94af1b5f0f081442f2ff0b2fae1f0a5f8a4f287f0a2f1c781432f2ff3a1f9aef0bdf3d1f8b2f991f0b1f0b8f2618144", "baseline_text": "하하하…어쩔 수 없네．//이걸 하지 않으면，//끝난 느낌이 안 나니까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ハハハ……しゃあないな。//これをやらんと、//終わった気がせぇへんしな。", "pointer_offset": 5440, "unit": "dialogue:00ff275268249b46", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0044", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6835, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f2cef455f7d1f0d8f27ef0f0f0ef81442f2ff0d8f2ca8143f1def0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "후훗…그렇네요．//그럼，갑니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ふふ……そうですね。//それじゃ、いきますよ！", "pointer_offset": 5444, "unit": "dialogue:6f5535e4b58d2941", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN#0045", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02003.SBN", "offset": 6880, "capacity": 12, "raw_hex": "f2d5f0aef8e1f1a3f1a4f7d1", "baseline_text": "승리의 포즈…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝利のポーズ……", "pointer_offset": 5448, "unit": "dialogue:eecef858d85488aa", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
